1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,720
MrBeastni quvmang.

2
00:00:03,090 --> 00:00:05,510
Bu bizga qimmatga tushdi.

3
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:10,900
10-oktabr kuni MrBeast Samarqanddagi Registonga keldi.

4
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:14,300
Uni yuzlab muxlislar o'rab oldi.

5
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:18,430
Odamlar suratga tushish uchun bir-birini itardi.

6
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:24,540
Xabarlarga ko'ra, ayrim bolalar yerga yiqilib, oyoq ostida qolish xavfi tug'ildi.

7
00:00:25,060 --> 00:00:29,230
Xavfsizlik xodimlari uni olomon orasidan zo'rg'a olib chiqdi.

8
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:35,470
MrBeastning o'zi mashinasi ortidan mingdan ortiq odam quvib kelganini aytdi.

9
00:00:35,950 --> 00:00:39,260
Buxoro viloyati IIB xodimi aytishicha,

10
00:00:39,260 --> 00:00:42,290
MrBeastning o'zi Buxoroga kelmaydi.

11
00:00:42,740 --> 00:00:45,890
U yerda faqat uning jamoasi suratga olmoqda.

12
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:49,250
Bu butun O'zbekiston emas.

13
00:00:49,630 --> 00:00:53,540
Lekin mehmon oldida ayrimlarimiz uyatga qoldik.

14
00:00:54,040 --> 00:00:55,710
Mehmonni quvmaymiz,

15
00:00:55,710 --> 00:00:57,320
kutib olamiz.

